### Practical No. 2 (B)
**Problem Statement:** Write a program to implement concept of 1D array and finding the sum of the array[cite: 13].

```c
#include <stdio.h>

int main() {
    int n, i, sum = 0;

    // Step 1: Ask the user for the number of elements
    printf("Enter the number of elements in the array: ");
    scanf("%d", &n);

    int arr[n]; // Step 2: Declare a 1D array of size n

    // Step 3: Input elements into the array
    printf("Enter %d elements:\n", n);
    for(i = 0; i < n; i++) {
        scanf("%d", &arr[i]);
    }

    // Step 4: Calculate the sum of array elements
    for(i = 0; i < n; i++) {
        sum += arr[i]; // sum = sum + arr[i]
    }

    // Step 5: Print the sum
    printf("The sum of the array elements is: %d\n", sum);

    return 0;
}
```[cite: 13, 14]

